				id: "2E0F21A354B50A54"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Autoclave"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The Twist:"
				""
				"Efficient Workhorse: This multiblock has a 16x input requirement and and a 16x output. Normally, this would cause a proportionate jump in energy demand and only work up to HV, but if you provide 8 mB of lubricant per recipe, the energy only scales as 4x in cost, allowing up to EV recipes."
			]
			id: "2EEA5482FC66177B"
